the shrink concept of the img if we don't use that the shrink when we reduce the size of that img will reduce its size but if we use the shrink concept with the shrink-0 it will stay the same img while reducing the size of the screen

another small word but imp "tracking-wide"
it's just the word where we used the spacing between words like hello to h e l l o this is called the tracking wide

Class	              Effect
tracking-tight	      letters closer
tracking-normal	      default
tracking-wide	      slightly spaced
tracking-wider	      more space
tracking-widest	      maximum space

